sequenceDiagram
    participant User as University Issuer
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant BE as FastAPI Backend
    participant DB as MySQL Database
    participant BC as Ethereum (Sepolia)

    User->>FE: Input Diploma Data
    FE->>BE: POST /api/diploma/prepare (data)
    BE->>BE: Generate SHA-256 Hash
    BE->>DB: Save Record (Status: Pending)
    BE-->>FE: Return recordId & diplomaHash
    
    FE->>FE: Request MetaMask Signature
    FE->>BC: storeDiplomaHash(hash, univId, studentId)
    BC-->>FE: Return Transaction Hash (txHash)
    
    FE->>BE: PATCH /api/diploma/confirm/{id} (txHash)
    BE->>DB: Update Record (Status: Success, tx_hash)
    BE-->>FE: Success Response
    FE-->>User: Diploma Issued Successfully
